	(text "FSM microcode: A[4:0]=ST, A5=START_ANY, A6=POINT_LAST, A7=MEM_ACK, A8=MEM_DONE, A9=REQ_DONE, A10=IMAGE_LAST, A11=FC_SEL.  ROM1[4:0]=next state, D5=BUSY, D6=DONE, D7=ACC_CLR_N; ROM2 D0=MAC_EN, D1=REQ, D2=WE, D3=NC (QSTB used directly), D4=ADD_SEL0, D5=ADD_SEL1, D6/D7=0.  DONE is routed to FC1_DONE/FC2_DONE by FC_SEL.  State sequence 0..12 as on S07.\nFC1: one S17 QSTB at BC=0.  FC2: QSTB at BC=0..3, DONE at BC=3; the byte counter (clocked by QSTB) addresses neuron*4+byte."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 620 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a8b1c82-4dfb-4674-aede-2d314539549a")
	)

	(text "A/B path: A_LAT/B_LAT 574 + four hold-enabled 574 stages per operand (16x157) + eight 27C512 (two per lane).  PROD=A*B; the pipeline is frozen during S02 wait states.  FC1 has 400 MACs and FC2 has 32, both exact multiples of four, so no padding is required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 650 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "094788b8-b50b-46cf-9de3-32b2621a7704")
	)

	(text "FC1 requant: Q = clamp(ACC >> 8, 0, 255), one QSTB at BC=0.  FC2: raw signed32 ACC, four QSTB pulses at BC=0..3 and DONE at BC=3; bytes are little-endian and Argmax compares the same scale.  No bias, no zero point, no M multiplier, no parameter loader."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 680 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bdbaa6cd-8854-4594-ae4f-853a35db3cce")
	)

	(text "Memory interface is shared: S02 drives MEM_nCE/nOE/nWE and MEM_ACK/DONE/BUSY globally; S11 merges FC_MEM_REQ/WE and maps the FC_MEM_nCE_* region code with FC_SEL to the FC1 or FC2 memory window.  The 74HC138 is qualified by active-low MEM_nCE; FC_ADDR is driven only while FC_BUSY=1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 710 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d4b712ca-55db-4c87-9591-0a62402eba04")
	)

